{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>陳松伶（松松）日前重返 TVB 作客資訊節目《流行都市》，廿四孝老公張鐸全程陪伴左右，更細心幫太太拍攝工作片段。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"697b3b59-a16e-4aaf-81ad-fda499accf6f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026TIEUyfnYP21789441233.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台</span>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_bed845f2816d0fdf-2280\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>據 TVB 娛樂新聞台報道，陳松伶身型愈來愈 Fit，狀態大勇。她笑言全靠老公平日不時叮囑自己做運動，甚至連擦牙時都可以把握時間做深蹲，希望自己在 60 歲時依然能保持健康的良好體態。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_bed845f2816d0fdf-2280\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"308deab0-c170-465a-a2fa-0c7888f961fe.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20262Fvp3qFIzV1789441233.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台</span>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d9659911-9a6f-478a-850a-6d130dbcd405.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026qHMz3NtP6V1789441232.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台</span>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_bed845f2816d0fdf-2281\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>張鐸又搞笑指太太以前是「黑妹」：「那時候她年紀小，黑黑的，感覺像是天天在海邊玩的樣子，頭髮短短的、大眼睛，不是那種傳統女孩子的形象。」不過，求生慾極強的張鐸立即大讚老婆的蛻變：「可是現在已經有很大的分別，她現在很白，很有女人味啊！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_bed845f2816d0fdf-2282\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>張鐸又不忘補充，指老婆變靚是自己的功勞：「現在認識我之後好很多了！」陳松伶聽完也忍不住反擊：「你怎麼那麼厚臉皮！」兩人公然在鏡頭前打情罵俏，場面十分溫馨搞笑。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T03:20:33.131520+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":388,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}